    "title": "Orioles place Rogers on injured list - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago The Orioles have lost another starting pitcher. The team announced this evening that left-hander Trevor Rogers went on the 15-day injured list with an undisclosed illness. The move is retroactive to Sunday. Reliever Cameron Foster is recalled from Triple-A Norfolk to give the team an extra reliever for Thursday’s doubleheader... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
